The a.m. glaze combinations show that one could realize many different appearances of cadmium red glazes and made them suitable for each existing firing cycle at that time. Later on in the 80ties of the last century the trend colour changed and the cadmium red, orange and yellow glazes started to disappear from the volume users: wall- and floor tiles. For art- , gift- and tableware the trend continued and the glazes are still applied today for these purposes.
